## 2. Auth layer — `backend/web-java/src/main/java/cn/yuanxin/mvp/web/auth/**`

**All classes (12):** `AuthController.java`, `AuthenticatedPrincipal.java`, `BearerAuthFilter.java`, `DeviceCredentialProvider.java`, `FaceClassification.java`, `FaceProvider.java`, `GimbalSessionController.java`, `PrincipalContext.java`, `PrincipalContextArgumentResolver.java`, `PrincipalRevalidator.java`, `PrincipalType.java`, `SessionProvider.java`.

**`PrincipalType`** (`PrincipalType.java`): `enum PrincipalType { APP, GIMBAL }`.

**`PrincipalContext`** (`PrincipalContext.java`) — record, full public API:
```java
public record PrincipalContext(
        PrincipalType principalType,
        UUID accountUuid,
        String installationId,
        UUID gimbalUuid,
        long credentialVersion,
        String sessionId,
        String requestId) {

    public static PrincipalContext forApp(AuthenticatedPrincipal p, String requestId) { ... }   // APP: accountUuid+installationId
    public static PrincipalContext forGimbal(AuthenticatedPrincipal p, String requestId) { ... } // GIMBAL: gimbalUuid+credentialVersion

    /** T13 principal_id：app_account = "<account_uuid>:<installation_id>"；gimbal = "<gimbal_uuid>"。 */
    public String t13PrincipalId() { ... }
    /** T13 principal_type 列取值。 */
    public String t13PrincipalType() { ... }   // APP -> "app_account", GIMBAL -> "gimbal"
}
```
Accessors: `principalType()`, `accountUuid()`, `installationId()`, `gimbalUuid()`, `credentialVersion()` (long; DB bigint, JSON decimal string), `sessionId()`, `requestId()`.

**`AuthenticatedPrincipal`** (`AuthenticatedPrincipal.java`): record `(PrincipalType principalType, UUID accountUuid, String installationId, UUID gimbalUuid, long credentialVersion, String sessionId, long authRevision)`; factories `app(...)` and `gimbal(...)`. Snapshot carries issue-time `accounts.auth_revision` / `gimbals.credential_version`.

**`BearerAuthFilter`** (`BearerAuthFilter.java`) — `@Component @Order(Ordered.HIGHEST_PRECEDENCE + 10)`:
```java
public static final String ATTR_PRINCIPAL = "mvp.principal";
private static final Set<String> PUBLIC = Set.of(
        "POST /api/v1/auth/sms-challenges",
        "POST /api/v1/auth/sessions",
        "POST /api/v1/auth/session-refreshes",
        "POST /api/v1/gimbal-sessions");
```
Behaviour: skips non-`/api/` and PUBLIC; missing/blank `Bearer ` → 401 `AUTH_REQUIRED`; `sessionProvider.authenticate(token)` (catch RuntimeException → 503 `DEPENDENCY_UNAVAILABLE`); empty → 401 `SESSION_INVALID`; then `revalidator.stillValid(p)` (catch → 503); invalid → 401 `SESSION_INVALID`; on success builds `PrincipalContext`, `request.setAttribute(ATTR_PRINCIPAL, ctx)`, MDC `principalType`/`principalRef`, then chain. 501 stubs run **after** this filter (unauthenticated first gets 401).

**`PrincipalRevalidator`** (`PrincipalRevalidator.java`) — per-request local recheck (single-row query, no JOIN/lock):
```java
public boolean stillValid(AuthenticatedPrincipal p) {
    return switch (p.principalType()) {
        case APP -> { /* SELECT status, auth_revision FROM accounts WHERE id = ? */
            yield !rows.isEmpty() && "active".equals(...) && auth_revision == p.authRevision(); }
        case GIMBAL -> { /* SELECT credential_version FROM gimbals WHERE id = ? */
            yield !rows.isEmpty() && rows.get(0) == p.credentialVersion(); }
    };
}
```
So: APP = account `status='active'` **and** `auth_revision` matches snapshot; GIMBAL = gimbal row exists **and** `credential_version` matches snapshot. Any mismatch → 401 SESSION_INVALID.

**The 4 adapter ports (interfaces):**
```java
// SessionProvider.java
public interface SessionProvider {
    Optional<AuthenticatedPrincipal> authenticate(String accessToken);
    IssuedAppSession createAppSession(UUID accountId, String installationId, long authRevision);
    Optional<IssuedAppSession> refreshAppSession(String refreshCredential); // must compare issue-time auth_revision (R2-2), never resurrect
    Optional<RevokedSession> revokeSession(String accessToken);
    IssuedGimbalSession createGimbalSession(UUID gimbalId, long credentialVersion);
    record IssuedAppSession(String accessToken, String refreshToken, UUID accountId,
                            String installationId, Instant expiresAt) {}
    record IssuedGimbalSession(String sessionToken, UUID gimbalId, long credentialVersion, Instant expiresAt) {}
    record RevokedSession(UUID accountId, String installationId, String sessionId) {} // sessionId == T09 session_ref
}

// DeviceCredentialProvider.java
public interface DeviceCredentialProvider {
    Optional<GimbalIdentity> verify(String credential, long credentialVersion, String proof);
    record GimbalIdentity(UUID gimbalId, String serialNo, long credentialVersion) {}
}

// SmsCodeProvider.java
public interface SmsCodeProvider {
    ChallengeOutcome issue(String phone, String purpose);
    Optional<String> verify(String challengeId, String code);   // success -> normalized login_subject
    record ChallengeOutcome(String challengeId, int retryAfterSeconds) {}
}

// FaceProvider.java
public interface FaceProvider {
    FaceClassification classify(String purpose, byte[] content);
}
```
`FaceClassification` enum: `MATCHED, RELIABLE_NEW, UNCERTAIN, QUALITY_REJECTED, DEPENDENCY_FAILED` (DEPENDENCY_FAILED never counts as match — fail closed).

**Gimbal credential validation path:** `GimbalSessionController` (`POST /api/v1/gimbal-sessions`, public) parses `credentialVersion` as decimal bigint string → `deviceCredentialProvider.verify(credential, version, proof)` → failure/version-mismatch → 401 AUTH_REQUIRED (no enumeration) → `sessionProvider.createGimbalSession(identity.gimbalId(), identity.credentialVersion())`. Dev double `DeviceCredentialDouble` consults **`gimbals` table columns `auth_subject_ref` (= submitted credential), `credential_version`, `serial_no`, `id`**:
```java
var rows = jdbc.query("SELECT id, serial_no, credential_version FROM gimbals"
                + " WHERE auth_subject_ref = ?", ...);
if (rows.isEmpty() || rows.get(0).credentialVersion() != credentialVersion) {
    return Optional.empty(); // 凭据或版本不符：统一失败，不区分（防枚举）
}
```
`DataAccessException` → empty (fail closed). Proof is not verified by the double (protocol not frozen).

