## 3. Media — `backend/web-java/.../media/**`

**`MediaAccessPolicy`** (`MediaAccessPolicy.java`) — exact signature:
```java
public interface MediaAccessPolicy {
    /** false → 与"资源不存在"完全一致的 404 RESOURCE_NOT_VISIBLE（绝不 403）。 */
    boolean canAccess(PrincipalContext principal, MediaObject media);
}
```

**`DenyAllMediaAccessPolicy`**: `canAccess(...) { return false; }` — production security default (any media GET → 404 RESOURCE_NOT_VISIBLE).

**Policy bean selection (`FoundationConfig.java`):**
```java
@Bean
@ConditionalOnMissingBean(MediaAccessPolicy.class)
public MediaAccessPolicy mediaAccessPolicy(AppProperties props) {
    AppProperties.Media media = props.media();
    if (media.allowAnyAuthenticated() || AppProperties.MEDIA_MODE_ANY_AUTHENTICATED.equals(media.accessModeOrDefault()))
        return new AllowAuthenticatedMediaAccessPolicy();
    if (AppProperties.MEDIA_MODE_OWNER_DEV.equals(media.accessModeOrDefault()))
        return new OwnerBasedMediaAccessPolicy();
    return new DenyAllMediaAccessPolicy();
}
```
So a business `@Primary MediaAccessPolicy` bean suppresses this fallback. **Startup failure mode:** `ProductionFailClosedValidator` (unconditional when `app.env=production`, independent of bean wiring): `allowAnyAuthenticated=true` or `access-mode != deny-all` → `IllegalStateException` at `afterSingletonsInstantiated()`; the 5 ports (SessionProvider/SmsCodeProvider/DeviceCredentialProvider/FaceProvider/StoragePort) must have a real (non-`.testdouble`, non-`Disabled*`) bean.

**`MediaIntakeService`** (`MediaIntakeService.java`) public API:
```java
public record IngestedMedia(String part, MediaObject media, String sha256Hex,
                            String contentType, long byteSize) {}
public static String sha256Hex(byte[] bytes)                                    // SHA-256 lowercase hex
public Map<String, IngestedMedia> ingest(PrincipalContext principal, MediaPurpose purpose,
                                         UUID t13RequestId, Map<String, byte[]> parts)
public static List<CanonicalObjectBuilder.PartDigest> partDigests(Map<String, byte[]> parts)
public static String sniffImageContentType(byte[] b)                            // jpeg/png/gif/webp magic; else UNSUPPORTED_IMAGE
```
`ingest` flow per part: `mediaService.createPending(purpose, principalType.lowercase, principal.t13PrincipalId(), t13RequestId)` → sniff → `storage.put(objectKey, stream, len, contentType)` → `markAvailable(id, detected, len, sha)`; failure → `mediaService.fail(...)` + rethrow.

**`MediaPurpose`** (`MediaPurpose.java`) enum values (DB CHECK): `ASSESSMENT_SOURCE("assessment_source")`, `ASSESSMENT_RESULT("assessment_result")`, `GRANT_FACE("grant_face")`, `EXECUTION_FACE("execution_face")`, `REVALIDATION_FACE("revalidation_face")`; `dbValue()`, `fromDbValue(String)`.

**Media GET/download (`MediaController.java`):** `@RequestMapping("/api/v1/media")` + `@GetMapping("/{mediaId}/content")` `content(@PathVariable UUID mediaId, PrincipalContext principal)`:
```java
MediaObject media = mediaService.load(mediaId);
if (media == null || !"available".equals(media.state()))
    throw new ApiException(ErrorCode.RESOURCE_NOT_VISIBLE, "media not visible");
if (!accessPolicy.canAccess(principal, media))          // 与"不存在"同一信封同一状态码
    throw new ApiException(ErrorCode.RESOURCE_NOT_VISIBLE, "media not visible");
InputStream in = mediaService.openContent(media);
...
return ResponseEntity.ok().contentType(...).cacheControl(CacheControl.noStore())
        .header("X-Content-Type-Options", "nosniff").body(new InputStreamResource(in));
```
`MediaService` API: `createPending(MediaPurpose purpose, String uploaderType, String uploaderRef, UUID requestId)` (object key = `props.env() + "/" + purpose + "/" + randomUUID`), `markAvailable(UUID mediaId, String contentType, long byteSize, String contentSha256Hex)` (image/* whitelist + `app.limits.image-max-bytes`), `fail(UUID mediaId, ErrorCode, String)`, `load(UUID)`, `openContent(MediaObject)` (only `available`; storage miss → null → 404). `StoragePort`: `void put(String objectKey, InputStream content, long byteSize, String contentType)`, `InputStream getStream(String objectKey)`, `byte[] get(String)`, `boolean exists(String)`, `void delete(String)`.

